<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Reference" Name="modPhaseTotal">
</Routine>
<Routine Use="Reference" Name="modTotal">
</Routine>
<Routine Use="Target" Name="Total" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Totalizer Routine]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================================================================================================================
                                                                                                             Total : Totalizers management for the system

                                                    List of treatments handled by the routine :
                                                         - Phase Totalizer Loop
                                                         - Totalizer Loop
                                                         - Reset flag
                                                    -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    History 
		2019-DEC-24 - Merck - Q. Spindler - Initial version for Candidate Release 1.00.00.00.a
                               2022-JAN-11 - Merck - Q. Spindler - Modifications for Candidate Release 1.01.00.00.a
  - Change Phase Totalizer size
==========================================================================================================================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Phase Totalizer Loop
==========================================================================================================================================================
The FOR NEXT loop will index through all totalizers.  The index value is equal to the array subscript value for the Totalizers UDT array.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[FOR(modPhaseTotal,Index,0,17,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Set the totalizer PV for concentration and diafiltration totalizers.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[MOV(FI201.CurrentValue,FQ_Conc.PV) ,MOV(FI201.CurrentValue,FQ_Diaf.PV) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Totalizer Loop
==========================================================================================================================================================
The FOR NEXT loop will index through all totalizers.  The index value is equal to the array subscript value for the Totalizers UDT array.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[FOR(modTotal,Index,0,1,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset flag
==========================================================================================================================================================
Clear the Reset All flag after it has been processed.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(TimerControl.ResetAll)OTU(TimerControl.ResetAll);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear the Reset Procedure flag after it has been processed.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(TimerControl.ResetProcedure)OTU(TimerControl.ResetProcedure);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
